# Docker integration disabled. The default Homepage entrypoint switches
# to PUID 1001 with su-exec, which drops supplementary groups — so even
# with `--group-add 119` the node process can't read /var/run/docker.sock.
# No service tile actually uses container state, so the integration is
# net cost (EACCES log spam) without benefit. Re-enable by populating
# `my-docker:` here AND running the container as root (PUID=0/PGID=0).
